      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these. the traditionalist one is good, but i feel like the progressive one sounds a bit... i dunno, maybe a little too aggressive or unstable? it makes them look like they're just angry for the sake of being angry. \n\ncan u try rewriting the progressive monologue so they sound more intellectual and composed? i want them to be radical and push for big changes, but i don't want them to sound irrational or desperate. i want them to be just as 'wise' and capable of a logical argument as the traditionalist.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
